<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="am">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ኢትዮጵያ ብሄራዊ ሎተሪ | የቤትና መኪና እድል</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #d4af37; /* Gold */
            --dark: #1a1a1a;
            --success: #28a745;
        }
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; margin: 0; background: #f0f2f5; color: #333; }
        
        header { 
            background: var(--dark); 
            color: var(--primary); 
            padding: 30px 10px; 
            font-size: 28px; 
            font-weight: bold;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .container { max-width: 1000px; margin: auto; padding: 20px; }

        .prize-container { 
            display: grid; 
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); 
            gap: 25px; 
            margin-top: 30px; 
        }

        .card { 
            background: white; 
            border-radius: 20px; 
            overflow: hidden; 
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }
        .card:hover { transform: translateY(-10px); }
        .card img { width: 100%; height: 220px; object-fit: cover; }
        .card-content { padding: 20px; }
        .card h3 { margin: 0; color: var(--dark); font-size: 22px; }

        .reg-form { 
            max-width: 500px; 
            margin: 50px auto; 
            background: white; 
            padding: 40px; 
            border-radius: 25px; 
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
            border-top: 5px solid var(--primary);
        }
        h2 { color: var(--dark); margin-bottom: 25px; }

        input, select, button { 
            width: 100%; 
            padding: 15px; 
            margin: 12px 0; 
            border-radius: 12px; 
            border: 2px solid #eee; 
            font-size: 16px;
            outline: none;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        input:focus { border-color: var(--primary); }

        .payment-info {
            background: #fff9e6;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            border-left: 5px solid var(--primary);
            font-size: 14px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            text-align: left;
        }

        button { 
            background: var(--success); 
            color: white; 
            border: none; 
            font-size: 18px; 
            font-weight: bold; 
            cursor: pointer; 
            margin-top: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(40, 167, 69, 0.3);
        }
        button:hover { background: #218838; }

        footer { margin-top: 50px; padding: 20px; color: #888; font-size: 13px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>🇪🇹 ኢትዮጵያ ብሄራዊ ሎተሪ</header>

<div class="container">
    <div class="prize-container">
        <div class="card">
            <img src="/images/house.jpg" alt="ሪል ስቴት">
            <div class="card-content">
                <h3>ባለ 3 ክፍል ዘመናዊ ሪል ስቴት</h3>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <img src="/images/car.jpg" alt="መኪና">
            <div class="card-content">
                <h3>የ2026 ቶዮታ ሃይለክስ መኪና</h3>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="reg-form">
        <h2>የእድል መመዝገቢያ ፎርም</h2>
        <form action="/buy" method="POST">
            <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="ሙሉ ስም" required>
            <input type="tel" name="phone" placeholder="ስልክ ቁጥር (ለምሳሌ 09...)" required>
            
            <label style="display:block; text-align:left; margin-left:5px;">የሚመርጡት ሽልማት፡</label>
            <select name="prizeType">
                <option value="ቤት">ሪል ስቴት ቤት</option>
                <option value="መኪና">ዘመናዊ መኪና</option>
            </select>
            
            <div class="payment-info">
                <strong>አከፋፈል፦</strong><br>
                በቴሌብር 10 ብር ወደ <b>0931136432</b> ከላኩ በኋላ፣ የደረሰኝ ቁጥሩን (Transaction ID) ከታች ያስገቡ።
            </div>
            
            <input type="text" name="transactionId" placeholder="የደረሰኝ ቁጥር (Transaction ID)" required>
            
            <button type="submit">አሁኑኑ ይሳተፉ</button>
        </form>
    </div>
</div>

<footer>&copy; 2026 ኢትዮጵያ ብሄራዊ ሎተሪ አስተዳደር። መብቱ የተጠበቀ ነው።</footer>

</body>
</html>
